        <activityName xml:lang="en">Waste paper, mixed, from public collection, for further treatment</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Waste paper, mixed, from public collection, for further treatment
na;
UUID: d9109552-bb79-3fc5-a06c-4c373333842b
This module includes the transportation efforts for the collection as well as the fruther transportation to the next paper production site / paper sorting plant. No further efforts are included into this module. The collected waste paper has a biogenic C content of 40.4% (average C-content of waste paper according to Doka 2004); Geography: Estimation from the author of the study, valuable for Switzerland.
Location:  Estimation from the author of the study, valuable for Switzerland.
Technology: Special lorry for collection - then average lorry for further transports
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Swiss paper / board collection: 1'094 kt (STAR report)
Sampling: Estimation 
Extrapolations: see geography and technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d9109552-bb79-3fc5-a06c-4c373333842b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
